OL,3,GNEWSAMedical record access given to
OL,4,Athree pharmacies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree pharmacies have been given access
OL,7,Fto patients' medical records to help
OL,8,Foffer "more effective care".
OL,10,FThe Government of Jersey said Reids in
OL,11,FSt Saviour, the Coop in St Clement and
OL,12,FLV in St Helier would be allowed to see
OL,13,Fwhat medicines people were taking, what
OL,14,Fvaccinations they have had and any
OL,15,Fconditions or allergies.
OL,17,FIt said the initiative would only be
OL,18,Faccessed "if required" to support
OL,19,Fpatients with their care and help
OL,20,Fprevent delays and return visits to the
OL,21,Fpharmacies when additional information
OL,22,Fwas needed.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
