OL,3,GNEWSAMedical record access given to
OL,4,Athree pharmacies
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial Security Minister Elaine Millar
OL,7,Fsaid it would mean GPs, pharmacists and
OL,8,Fhealthcare professionals could work
OL,9,Fmore efficiently together.
